---
import { DIAGNOSE_MAILTO } from '../lib/constants';
---
<section class="flex items-start px-6 lg:px-8 pt-40 lg:pt-32 pb-16">
  <div class="max-w-4xl w-full mx-auto">
    <p class="text-[0.6875rem] font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-steel uppercase mb-8">
      Build-Operate-Transfer · Executive Leadership · Romania
    </p>
    <h1 class="text-[2.25rem] lg:text-[2.75rem] font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground mb-6 leading-[1.15]">
      Interim Managing Director for your Romania delivery hub &mdash; built, run, then handed to your permanent local leader.
    </h1>
    <p class="text-slate text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-2xl">
      BMP steps in as interim MD to launch and govern your Romanian engineering office under your brand and P&amp;L logic. When the operation is stable, we recruit, mentor, and transfer to the leader you keep. You get executive control from week one and a clean exit when you are ready.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-8 text-slate text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed" aria-label="Track record">
      Three Romania hubs stood up · Two subsidiaries run as Managing Director · Active Build–Operate–Transfer in flight
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-3 mb-12">
      <a
        href={DIAGNOSE_MAILTO}
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-foreground px-5 py-3 text-[0.875rem] font-semibold text-on-primary transition-opacity hover:opacity-85 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-foreground focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-offset-zinc-950"
      >
        Book a diagnose call (go / no-go in two weeks)
      </a>
      <a
        href="#how-it-works"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-divider px-5 py-3 text-[0.875rem] font-semibold text-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-steel-light focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-foreground focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-offset-zinc-950"
      >
        See how Build &rarr; Operate &rarr; Transfer works
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="pt-6 border-t border-divider text-steel text-[0.75rem] tracking-wide">
      Delivery · Operations · Scaling · Governance · Leadership transfer
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
